Outflow Rate [Mixer]
Type the Outflow Rate into the text box. This is the rate with which the material flows out of the object
and flows through the objects of type Pipe to the next object in the flow of materials.
Remarks
The Outflow Rate is the amount of liters of the material that flows off in a second.
Note
The current Outflow Rate
  depends on the number of attached Pipes. Let's say you attached two
Pipes , then the specified Outflow Rate flows through each one of these Pipes in case the Outflow Rate
of the connected Pipes enables this.
If you just want to let the specified amount flow out of the object, attach a single Pipe and split that up
into several Pipes later on.
SimTalk
OutflowRate [SimTalk] - Mixer
Outflow Rate [Mixer]
