Materials Table [Mixer]
The MaterialsTable object contains the data of the different materials which the Mixer can mix.
Remarks
Click the ellipsis button and select the MaterialsTable in the dialog Select Object.
Or select the MaterialsTable in a Frame, drag it to the text box and drop it there.
If you type -1 for a recipe into the column Product Amount of the MaterialsTable of the Mixer, Plant
Simulation assumes the sum of all ingredients as the Product Amount. You only have to explicitly specify
the Product Amount if mixing the ingredients increases or decreases the volume, i.e., if the Product
Amount is not the sum of the ingredients.
