Tab Importer
On the Tab Importer you can define services for processing the parts, for setting the station up for a
certain type of part, and for repairing the station.
To view Importer Statistics in the Statistics Report, do one of the following:
• Select View > Show Statistics Report in the dialog of the object.
• Click the object with the right mouse button in the Frame and select Show Statistics Report or press
F6.
• Click Show Statistics Report on the Home ribbon tab.
